# Repository-wide line-ending policy.
#
# Distribution artifacts (templates/, .claude/commands/codexspec/, .agents/skills/)
# are compared byte-for-byte by maintainer tooling (internal/command_template_fragments.py
# --check-distribution) and by the test suite, so the working tree must materialize
# identical bytes on every platform. Normalize all text files to LF on checkout;
# git leaves genuinely binary files untouched (text=auto detection).
* text=auto eol=lf
